OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police respond to incident
OL,4,Aas residents told to avoid area
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police have been responding to an
OL,7,Fincident that has caused disruption in
OL,8,Fthe Morriston area of Swansea.
OL,10,FResidents have been told to avoid the
OL,11,Farea and events, including a local
OL,12,Ffirework display, have been cancelled.
OL,14,FVideo circulating online shows police
OL,15,Fofficers next to a stationary car that
OL,16,Fappears to have been struck by a
OL,17,Fshotgun blast on Clase Road near an
OL,18,FAsda superstore.
OL,20,FA National Police Air Service
OL,21,Fhelicopter was circling the area but
OL,22,Fhas since returned to base.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
